cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use webGrainy, please cite the ImageGrains and Cellpose publications listed
  under "references" (the scientific methods and model weights), and optionally this
  software. webGrainy is an independent, unofficial browser port and is not endorsed
  by the ImageGrains or Cellpose authors.
title: "webGrainy (ImageGrains 2.0 Web): browser-native grain segmentation and grain-size statistics"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/LukeAFullard/webGrainy"
authors:
  - name: "webGrainy / ImageGrains 2.0 Web Contributors"
keywords:
  - grain size
  - sedimentology
  - fluvial geomorphology
  - photo-sieving
  - instance segmentation
  - onnxruntime-web
references:
